      ],
      "text": "The agent loop reportedly supports browser automation (navigate, click, fill forms, scrape, screenshot), web search and page fetching, shell command execution, Office file read/write, and integration of MCP-compatible servers over SSE, Stdio, or StreamableHTTP, with tool invocations shown transparently."
