        "slc_2368413cc1bee1d593d4849f2632ae19ced138844edd83e238ac83fcbfd053b8"
      ],
      "text": "The RAG subsystem ingests documents (PDF, Word, Excel) with automatic chunking, embedding, and indexing, performs semantic retrieval before each LLM response, supports pluggable embedding providers, and organizes knowledge into isolated stores assignable per chat or application."
